# .m4b audiobooks open in Books (hidden from the launcher: Alt+b opens Books)
[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Books
Comment=Listen to audiobooks: remembers where you stopped, chapters, bookmarks
Exec=books %f
Icon=audio-x-generic
Terminal=false
Categories=AudioVideo;Audio;Player;
MimeType=audio/x-m4b;
NoDisplay=true
X-Apphide=edited
